---
title: "Rewrite CI/CD to use changelogger-cli v0.2.1 from crates.io"
doc:
  - audience: Developer
    description: |
      Rewrote all CI/CD workflows to use changelogger-cli v0.2.1
      from crates.io. Added command-prdoc.yml for manual prdoc
      generation. CD now generates CHANGELOG.md on version bump.
      Release generates CHANGELOG, commits it, creates GitHub
      Release with notes. Updated all templates and docs.
crates:
  - name: rusty-repo-cli
    bump: minor
